# test/
#
# This directory contains workload testing scripts for the autonomous cloud agent evaluation.
#
# Contents (tracked locally, ignored by .gitignore):
#   locustfile.py  — Locust load test for the UniVeranstaltungen MERN application.
#                    Defines four concurrent user classes (LoginBurner, StudentBrowser,
#                    OfficerBurner, AdminBurner) that drive realistic HTTP traffic to the
#                    ALB endpoint and trigger ASG CPU-based scaling policies.
#
# To run:
#   pip install locust
#   locust -f test/locustfile.py --host http://<ALB-DNS>
